{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 14, :comments ["<b>The third time</b><br>“Flee, my beloved.” Knesset Israel says: If you desire to hear my songs, come down to me and flee from the place of your companions — they are the ministering angels who serve before you — and come to the mountains of spices, the mountains of Zion, where YHWH ordained the blessing of eternal life." "(Completed: the commentary on Song of Songs. Praise to the Maker of lights.)"], :book :song-of-songs, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 8, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra's commentary on the Canticles" "http://beta.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH002030344/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:45:20.965324772Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}